{"results":[{"rowIndex":274,"group":"1","grade":8,"candidate":"C1","reason":"Covers needing the ellipse made and labelled, connecting Customer growth to Signups, and the appreciation.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":274,"group":"2","grade":8,"candidate":"C2","reason":"Preserves the make, label, connect, and appreciate clauses with their participants.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":274,"group":"5","grade":8,"candidate":"C5","reason":"Links you to making the labelled ellipse and sequences the connection before the appreciation.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":274,"group":"6","grade":8,"candidate":"C6","reason":"Captures the requested ellipse, its label, the connection to Signups, and the final statement.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":274,"group":"7","grade":8,"candidate":"C7","reason":"Represents needing you to make the labelled ellipse, then connecting it to Signups.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":274,"group":"8","grade":8,"candidate":"C8","reason":"Preserves all three clauses and the ellipse label and connection endpoint.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":275,"group":"0","grade":1,"candidate":"C0","reason":"Treats Review North Area as a separate imperative instead of the task being given.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":275,"group":"1","grade":8,"candidate":"C1","reason":"Gives me a task to review North Area, quickly and politely.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":275,"group":"2","grade":8,"candidate":"C2","reason":"Links the Review North Area clause to the task and keeps the recipient and speed.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":275,"group":"5","grade":3,"candidate":"C5","reason":"Makes Review the task's head and North Area its label, changing their relationship.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":275,"group":"6","grade":8,"candidate":"C6","reason":"Preserves the task, its Review North Area content, the recipient, and quickly.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":275,"group":"7","grade":3,"candidate":"C7","reason":"Attaches quickly to the task entity rather than the giving or reviewing.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":276,"group":"2","grade":3,"candidate":"C2","reason":"Both in relations point to evening, leaving the fair's relation to the sun wrong.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":276,"group":"4","grade":8,"candidate":"C4","reason":"Captures the fair's setting and all four items with their properties and placements.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":276,"group":"5","grade":3,"candidate":"C5","reason":"Treats a summer fair as a result complement and degree instead of the thing to draw.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":276,"group":"6","grade":3,"candidate":"C6","reason":"Misassigns the fair and several placements, including putting the umbrella above the standing vendor's stand relation.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":277,"group":"1","grade":1,"candidate":"C1","reason":"Turns face and white into predicates and loses the intended scene structure.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":277,"group":"4","grade":3,"candidate":"C4","reason":"Places the surprised face next to the table instead of the boy.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":277,"group":"5","grade":8,"candidate":"C5","reason":"Captures the picnic spot, mist and dawn, and each item with its placement and properties.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":277,"group":"6","grade":1,"candidate":"C6","reason":"Misreads white as a predicate and breaks the placements of the table, swans, and girl.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":278,"group":"0","grade":8,"candidate":"C0","reason":"Coordinates undoing the last swap and redoing the same swap.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":278,"group":"1","grade":8,"candidate":"C1","reason":"Preserves both imperative actions and their distinct swap references.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":278,"group":"2","grade":3,"candidate":"C2","reason":"Records last as a quantity rather than the qualifier identifying the swap.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":278,"group":"3","grade":8,"candidate":"C3","reason":"Correctly joins undo the last swap with redo the same swap.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":278,"group":"4","grade":8,"candidate":"C4","reason":"Includes both coordinated commands and the last and same qualifiers.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":278,"group":"5","grade":8,"candidate":"C5","reason":"Preserves both imperative predicates and their swap objects.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":279,"group":"5","grade":3,"candidate":"C5","reason":"Makes jsut the render object and attaches as a column chart to ordered rather than to the rendering.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":280,"group":"6","grade":3,"candidate":"C6","reason":"Misattaches then to ease and represents Coca Cola as separate nested names.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":280,"group":"7","grade":3,"candidate":"C7","reason":"Keeps the two actions but splits the Coca Cola reference and weakens the right-side-level relation.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":280,"group":"8","grade":3,"candidate":"C8","reason":"Attaches then to the Texaco block and untouched as a row modifier rather than the result of keeping it.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":280,"group":"9","grade":3,"candidate":"C9","reason":"Captures ease and then keep, but splits Coca Cola and treats right side level as apposition.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":281,"group":"0","grade":8,"candidate":"C0","reason":"Represents the belief, should modality, and making the e1 arrow jump over the e3 one.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":281,"group":"1","grade":8,"candidate":"C1","reason":"Preserves I think, you should make, and the e1 arrow jumping over the e3 one.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":281,"group":"4","grade":8,"candidate":"C4","reason":"Keeps the modal causative structure and the two arrow references.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":281,"group":"5","grade":8,"candidate":"C5","reason":"Correctly links make to the arrow's jump over the e3 one.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":281,"group":"6","grade":5,"candidate":"C6","reason":"The arrow's jump is present but is not linked as the complement of make.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":281,"group":"7","grade":3,"candidate":"C7","reason":"Makes e1 the direct object separate from arrow and treats one as a result complement.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":282,"group":"6","grade":8,"candidate":"C6","reason":"Sets the colour bar length to medium, identifies that as the tweak, and places the y axis on the right.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":282,"group":"7","grade":8,"candidate":"C7","reason":"Preserves the medium length, tweak statement, while clause, and y-axis placement.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":282,"group":"8","grade":7,"candidate":"C8","reason":"Medium is only an apposition to length, rather than the value to set it to.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":282,"group":"9","grade":1,"candidate":"C9","reason":"Misreads the initial set command as nonfinite and makes medium its object.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":282,"group":"10","grade":1,"candidate":"C10","reason":"Misreads the initial imperative as nonfinite and makes medium its predicative entity.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":283,"group":"1","grade":1,"candidate":"C1","reason":"Classifies getting the cloud row out as placement, reversing the first action.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":283,"group":"2","grade":1,"candidate":"C2","reason":"The first get out clause is wrongly classified as placement.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":283,"group":"3","grade":3,"candidate":"C3","reason":"Makes clouds out an entity and wrongly coordinates the lake with the single bird.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":283,"group":"4","grade":3,"candidate":"C4","reason":"Makes clouds out an entity and attaches on top of them to the line rather than the one bird.","referenceIssue":null},{"rowIndex":283,"group":"5","grade":8,"candidate":"C5","reason":"Preserves getting the cloud row out, placing a line of three birds above the lake, then one bird atop them; thanks is a fragment.","referenceIssue":null}]}
